<title>USA: Sioux City feeder cattle market not tested - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City feeder cattle market not tested - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Not enough feeder steers and heifers were on hand to test the market, USDA said. There will be no weighted average report compiled this week.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
